    gameId: 'laugavatnsmanni',
    icon: '🃏',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Contract Selection**: Each player must play each of the 6 contracts exactly once over 18 deals. The first time you are declarer, you may choose any contract. The next time, you choose from the remaining 5, and so on. 2. **The Exchange**: Before play begins, the declarer (player to dealer's left) may discard up to 4 cards and draw replacements from the Manni pile. The second player may then exchange up to 4 of the remaining cards. The dealer takes whatever is left in the Manni (if any). 3. **Trick Play**: Declarer leads to the first trick. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may play any card. Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit if no trumps. Winner leads to next trick.",
    Player: "1. **Contract Selection**: Each player must play each of the 6 contracts exactly once over 18 deals. The first time you are declarer, you may choose any contract. The next time, you choose from the remaining 5, and so on. 2. **The Exchange**: Before play begins, the declarer (player to dealer's left) may discard up to 4 cards and draw replacements from the Manni pile. The second player may then exchange up to 4 of the remaining cards. The dealer takes whatever is left in the Manni (if any). 3. **Trick Play**: Declarer leads to the first trick. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may play any card. Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit if no trumps. Winner leads to next trick.",
    objective: 'Accumulate the most points by winning tricks relative to your contract target. Game ends after 18 deals (each player plays each of the 6 contracts exactly once).',
    gameplay: "1. **Contract Selection**: Each player must play each of the 6 contracts exactly once over 18 deals. The first time you are declarer, you may choose any contract. The next time, you choose from the remaining 5, and so on. 2. **The Exchange**: Before play begins, the declarer (player to dealer's left) may discard up to 4 cards and draw replacements from the Manni pile. The second player may then exchange up to 4 of the remaining cards. The dealer takes whatever is left in the Manni (if any). 3. **Trick Play**: Declarer leads to the first trick. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may play any card. Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit if no trumps. Winner leads to next trick.",
    keyRules: [
      'Contracts: Nullo (lose all tricks), Grand (win most tricks), Spades, Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs (suit trumps).',
      'Nullo: No trumps. Ace is low, ranking below the 3.',
      'Grand/Suits: Ace is high.',
      'Grand/Suits target: 8 tricks for declarer, 4 for each defender.',
      'Nullo target: 4 tricks for declarer, 6 for each defender.',
      'Score +1 point for each trick above target, -1 for each trick below target (Nullo is inverted).',
      'Final score = positive points minus negative points.',
