    turnFlow: "1. **Contract Selection**: Each player must play each of the 6 contracts exactly once over 18 deals. The first time you are declarer, you may choose any contract. The next time, you choose from the remaining 5, and so on. 2. **The Exchange**: Before play begins, the declarer (player to dealer's left) may discard up to 4 cards and draw replacements from the Manni pile. The second player may then exchange up to 4 of the remaining cards. The dealer takes whatever is left in the Manni (if any). 3. **Trick Play**: Declarer leads to the first trick. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may play any card. Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit if no trumps. Winner leads to next trick.",
